  "voiceKey": "gemini:Erinome",
  "speechPersonality": "Voix claire, chaleureuse, médium, débit calme et articulé. Elle s'exprime avec des phrases structurées, un vocabulaire professionnel simple. Sourit en parlant, pose des questions ouvertes, reformule, utilise des formules rassurantes. Tact, ton posé, humour léger.",
  "posePrompts": {
    "neutral": "Karine stands with a serene, attentive expression, her head slightly tilted, conveying active listening and thoughtful engagement. Her posture is open and balanced, with shoulders relaxed and arms gently at her sides, ready to engage.",
    "success": "Karine smiles warmly, her eyes sparkling with approval and genuine satisfaction. She makes a subtle, encouraging gesture with one hand, palm slightly open and raised, conveying shared success and appreciation for effort.",
    "failure": "Karine maintains a calm, understanding expression, her gaze empathetic and reassuring. She offers a gentle, open-palm gesture with one hand, inviting another attempt with empathy and unwavering support."
