    "fullBody": "A complete full-body image of Karine, a woman with short, neatly styled brown hair, parted on the side. Her round face features warm brown eyes and a calm, confident, and approachable expression, enhanced by a gentle, natural smile and subtle, natural makeup. She is dressed in a professional and elegant ensemble: a crisp white single-breasted blazer with a structured lapel, a simple black crew-neck top, and well-tailored black trousers. She completes her outfit with black closed-toe low-heeled pumps. A small, elegant gold-colored lapel pin is visible on her left blazer lapel, and a simple ring adorns her left hand. She stands naturally with a confident and balanced posture, her weight evenly distributed. Her arms are relaxed at her sides, hands gently resting, conveying an open and poised demeanor. Her head is held level, looking directly forward, projecting presence and approachability. The image ensures Karine is shown from head to toe, with every extremity and all equipment visible, including both shoes. Generous margins surround her, preventing any cropping of her body or outfit. Bright, even studio lighting from the front creates a clean, professional look with soft shadows. The background is a plain, light gray, providing a clean and professional setting without distraction."
